# taf.ul.oran_mplane

[![Documentation](https://docs.taf.ute.nsn-rdnet.net/projects/taf-ul-oran_mplane/badge/)][1]
[![Requirements](https://taf.wrgitlab-pages.int.net.nokia.com/miscellaneous/static-badges/requirements.svg)](requirements/base.txt)
[![build status](https://wrgitlab.int.net.nokia.com/TAF/taf.ul.oran_mplane/badges/main/pipeline.svg)][2]
[![coverage report](https://wrgitlab.int.net.nokia.com/TAF/taf.ul.oran_mplane/badges/main/coverage.svg)][2]
[![latest release](https://wrgitlab.int.net.nokia.com/TAF/taf.ul.oran_mplane/-/badges/release.svg)][3]


Library to simulate management plane between DU and RU according to ORAN requirements.
https://nokia.sharepoint.com/sites/SM-RM_IDT/Public%20Specifications/Forms/IDT%20View.aspx?csf=1&web=1&e=xueGgR&cid=d7a116e2%2D6e49%2D484f%2D9bc9%2D70d168694117&FolderCTID=0x0120001AA09F27E0691642AD5458BB28D56FB0&OR=Teams%2DHL&CT=1632141627538&id=%2Fsites%2FSM%2DRM%5FIDT%2FPublic%20Specifications%2FORAN%2FORAN%20M%20plane%2FO%2DRAN%2EWG4%2EMP%2E0%2Dv07%2E00%2E00%2Epdf&parent=%2Fsites%2FSM%2DRM%5FIDT%2FPublic%20Specifications%2FORAN%2FORAN%20M%20plane

It is implementation for Mobile Networks usage which base on pypi NETCONF Client: https://pypi.org/project/ncclient/


## Supported Python versions

Library should work properly with Python versions specified within
`python_requires` option in [setup.py](setup.py).

## Installation

Generic library installation process is described in [TAF user guide][4].

## Examples
Stored in "examples" directory.

Manual Usage:
```
import logging as logger
from mock import patch
from taf.ul.oran_mplane.interface import OranMplane

RPC_DIRECTORY = r"/home/ute/rpcs"
NETCONF_CLIENT_IP = "172.17.0.1"
NETCONF_CLIENT_PORT = 4334

patch("logging.debug", print).start()
ROUTER = {"session1": {"host": NETCONF_CLIENT_IP, "port": NETCONF_CLIENT_PORT, "username": "root",
                       "password": "root", "timeout": 60}}

CONNECTION = OranMplane(router=ROUTER, logger=logger, protocol="ssh")
CONNECTION.rpc_talker(rpc_directory=RPC_DIRECTORY, session="session1")
```
Example RCP msg for manual usage defined in *.xml file.
```
<rpc xmlns="urn:ietf:params:xml:ns:netconf:base:1.0" message-id="1">
	<get xmlns="urn:ietf:params:xml:ns:netconf:base:1.0">
		<filter type="xpath" xmlns:yanglib="urn:ietf:params:xml:ns:yang:ietf-yang-library" select="/yanglib:*"/>
	</get>
</rpc>
```

Test Automation Usage:
```
import logging as logger
from mock import patch
from taf.ul.oran_mplane.interface import OranMplane

patch("logging.debug", print).start()
ROUTER = {"session1": {"host": "172.17.0.2", "port": 830, "username": "root",
                       "password": "root"}}
GET_EXAMPLE_DEFAULT = {
    "request": "<operational-info xmlns='urn:o-ran:operations:1.0'><clock><timezone-utc-offset>"
               "</timezone-utc-offset></clock></operational-info>",
    "expected_response": "<timezone-utc-offset>0</timezone-utc-offset>"
}
EDIT_CONFIG_EXAMPLE = {
    "request": "<operational-info xmlns='urn:o-ran:operations:1.0'><clock><timezone-utc-offset>"
               "10</timezone-utc-offset></clock></operational-info>",
    "expected_response": "<ok/>"
}
GET_EXAMPLE_MODIFIED = {
    "request": "<operational-info xmlns='urn:o-ran:operations:1.0'><clock><timezone-utc-offset>"
               "</timezone-utc-offset></clock></operational-info>",
    "expected_response": "<timezone-utc-offset>10</timezone-utc-offset>"
}
EDIT_CONFIG_EXAMPLE_TO_DEFAULT = {
    "request": "<operational-info xmlns='urn:o-ran:operations:1.0'><clock><timezone-utc-offset>"
               "0</timezone-utc-offset></clock></operational-info>",
    "expected_response": "<ok/>"
}
oran_object = OranMplane(router=ROUTER, logger=logger)
oran_object.connect(session="session1")
oran_object.create_subscription(session="session1")
oran_object.get(session="session1", msg_format="xml", msg=GET_EXAMPLE_DEFAULT)
oran_object.edit_config(session="session1", msg=EDIT_CONFIG_EXAMPLE)
oran_object.get(session="session1", msg_format="xml", msg=GET_EXAMPLE_MODIFIED)
oran_object.collect_notification(session="session1", noti_filter="timezone-utc-offset", timeout=30)
oran_object.edit_config(session="session1", msg=EDIT_CONFIG_EXAMPLE_TO_DEFAULT)
oran_object.clear_notifications_buffer_for_all_sessions()
oran_object.close_all_sessions()
```

TLS connection:
```
router = {
    "master_0": {
        'host': '2001:db8:1::1',
        'port': 6513,
        'timeout': 120,
        'hostkey_verify': True,
        'look_for_keys': True,
        'keyfile': "/home/ute/netconf_certs/client_alt/client.key",
        'certfile': "/home/ute/netconf_certs/client_alt/client.crt",
        'ca_certs': "/home/ute/netconf_certs/ca/ca.crt",
        "server_hostname": "tls-test"
    }
}
o = OranMplane(router, logger=logger, protocol="tls")

o.connection.connect_tls("master_0")
o.get_config("master_0", "running")
o.create_subscription("master_0")

o.close_session("master_0")

# Confluence page to TLS based connection details
https://confluence.ext.net.nokia.com/display/RFSW/Oran+TLS
```

